        "created_at": "2025-07-27T18:51:16.123389+00:00",
        "notes": "For some reason, when i was making this build it went really well and i ended up with 16k this round. Im not expecting you to replicate that, so i made it in mind with around 10-11k in mind, if it goes really well, get either  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a),  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56).\nOr just get  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce).\n\nFor this round you need to start focusing down their support as much as possible, since thats gonna net you a lot of value for your team.\nBuy   [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) + what you would like from the optionals.\n\nRemember to look at your money during the round, if you're behind the lobby, start farming off their tank (still dive if there is a support whose alone like zen or ana)\n\nIf its a matchup where its easy to get in/out without anyone chasing you, Get  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) instead of  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016). Then buy something from the optionals, i would get  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n\nIf you realise you're poor and need to farm this round. Get  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) +  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) or  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34).",
