        "created_at": "2025-07-27T18:51:16.123389+00:00",
        "notes": "For powers you can either get [Hanamura Healing](item_d210417d-1e30-4571-a4f3-cccd1dfc23ca). For more Tankiness, this is what i get when my enemies' positioning is great and i need the tankiness to get to them. Here you can get  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) or  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce).\n\nyou could also go  [Dragon's Breath](item_32dc8374-7541-46fb-9891-29b7fbe9ed4d) If you want more damage off your  [Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168). You should only really get this if you can afford a lot of weapon power. Get either  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), if you would rather buff your backstab melee. in the upcoming rounds i'l put some options for this route.\n\nThe Last one is  [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe). This is great if you want to get a lot of  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), And need the extra damage. I would use swift strike towards the start of my combo to have the laceration help against their healing. For this path get  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) or [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n\nI haven't seen a lot of people use  [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) but i feel its great vs an annoying mercy or freja.\n\nVs great supports you could get  [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) when you're going for  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), and [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) when you're going for  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
